<title>USA: Pitney Bowes to buy back up to 9.2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Pitney Bowes to buy back up to 9.2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pitney Bowes Inc said on Monday that it will buy up to 9.2 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>As of the end of its fourth quarter, the company had approximately 150 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
